# Example allowed-volume list for konnectors local-files.
#
# Copy outside the repo, for example:
#   ~/code/mcp/local-files-volumes.conf
#
# One absolute path per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
# Paths may contain spaces. Optional surrounding double quotes are stripped.
# Never commit a machine-specific copy of this file.
#
# Adding a volume: append one line, then restart the MCP server / launch script.

/path/to/REPLACE_ME_volume_one
/path/to/REPLACE_ME_volume_two
"/path/to/REPLACE_ME volume with spaces"
